# api_rotate_large_angle.expect — `cw 270`, `ccw 360`, `cw 360` turn the full angle, in the commanded direction
# `cw 270`・`ccw 360`・`cw 360` は、指令の向きに指令の角度だけ回る
#
# yaw_turn_deg is the signed change of the TRUE heading (truth, unwrapped) over each 14 s window: the
# angle itself, not a log line. The tolerance is the firmware's completion tolerance (0.17 rad = 9.7
# deg) plus the overshoot. Before the fix: cw 270 turned -90 deg (the other way), cw 360 turned 0.
# yaw_turn_deg は各 14 s の窓での「真値」方位（アンラップ済み）の符号付き変化: ログ行でなく角度
# そのもの。許容差はファームの完了許容差（0.17 rad = 9.7 度）にオーバーシュートを足した値。
# 修正前: cw 270 は -90 度（逆向き）、cw 360 は 0 度だった。
exit 0
log_contains any "cmd: cw 270"
log_contains any "cmd: ccw 360"
log_contains any "cmd: cw 360"
log_absent  any "error rotate timeout"
log_absent  any "Guidance cancelled by pilot stick"
order "cmd: cw 270" "cmd: ccw 360"
order "cmd: ccw 360" "cmd: cw 360"
order "cmd: cw 360" "cmd: land"
metric yaw_turn_deg > 261 in 22.0 36.0
metric yaw_turn_deg < 279 in 22.0 36.0
metric yaw_turn_deg < -351 in 36.0 50.0
metric yaw_turn_deg > -369 in 36.0 50.0
metric yaw_turn_deg > 351 in 50.0 64.0
metric yaw_turn_deg < 369 in 50.0 64.0
# Net of the three turns: 270 - 360 + 360 = 270 deg. / 3 回の合計: 270 - 360 + 360 = 270 度。
metric yaw_turn_deg > 261 in 22.0 64.0
metric yaw_turn_deg < 279 in 22.0 64.0
# The craft stays in the air and level through the turns. / 回頭中も機体は空中で水平。
metric alt_min > 0.8 in 22.0 64.0
metric tilt_max < 0.2618 in 22.0 64.0   # 15.0 deg
